
§§ `s 376F`

-- s 376F(2): procurement of sexual activity with person with mental disability
-- @fixture `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1` OF `Mental Disability Procurement Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T A intentionally touches B
-- T the touching is sexual
-- T B consents to the touching
-- T B is not A's spouse
-- T A obtains B's consent by means of an inducement offered or given by A for that purpose
-- T B has a mental disability within section 376F(5)
-- T A knows or could reasonably be expected to know that B has a mental disability
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376F(2)` `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376F(2)` `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376F(2)` `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1`)'s section EQUALS "376F(2)"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376F(2)` `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1`)'s offence EQUALS "procurement of sexual activity with person with mental disability"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376F(2)` `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 5 years, or with fine, or with caning, or with any combination of such punishments"
#ASSERT NOT ((`charge under s 376F(2)` `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1`)'s text EQUALS "")
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376F(2)` `Mental Disability Procurement 376F(2) via 1`)'s refusal EQUALS ""
